OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with some frost and fog
OL,7,Fpatches. Then it will stay dry for the
OL,8,Frest of the night but clouding over
OL,9,Flater. Southerly winds strengthening
OL,10,Ftoo.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FAfter a dry start it will
OL,13,Fbecome cloudy with rain spreading
OL,14,Fnorth in the afternoon, turning
OL,15,Fheavier in the evening, Argyll likely
OL,16,Fto see the best of any dry weather.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,19,Fspells and a few showers on Sunday.
OL,20,FMild and windy with rain on Monday.
OL,21,FMainly dry and bright on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
